{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Functional Requirements Components"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about the components of the functional requirements. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Make the coding of the system modules and the main program, starting from using the chosen programming language, based on design specifications.  Exchanges information about requirements types and their characteristics."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on the graphic layout of an IT solution, functional requirements of a business through the IT solution, and the functional phase of an IT project."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Had Better for What Is Advisable"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">had better </span> to share ideas with others regarding what we believe is the best action to take in a specific situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use <span class=\"strong\">had better</span>, you are trying to give a recommendation about a present situation in which you are telling another person what to do. The use of <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> suggests that if the other person does not follow what you propose, a bad consequence will happen. <br/> <br/>    To make sentences using <span class=\"strong\">had better</span>, you have to follow the next structure: <br/><br/>  <div class=\"center_text\">Subject + <span class=\"strong\">Had better</span> + Verb (base form) + Complement</div><br/><br/>   Examples: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> check the functional requirements. </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">The company <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> show interest on developing good functional requirements on their systems. </span><br/><br/>  Remember that you can also use the abbreviation of <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> which is \u201c<span class=\"strong\">\u2018d better</span>\u201d.<br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You<span class=\"strong\">'d better</span> check the functional requirements. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Well, you had better ask Peter."}, {"type": "example", "content": "With our technology, technicians and other professionals had better see entries that describe who can access the inventory and the way people will register products."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What a Functional Requirement Should Include"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Functional requirements must include specific characteristics that you have to know and identify.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about functional requirements, you make reference to the services and functions that the system must provide. The behavior of the system in different situations is also detailed through these requirements. Now, in order to accomplish a function, the functional requirements must fulfill some parameters: <br/> <br/>  Every functional requirement has to\u2026 <br/> <br/>  <ul> <li> Have a distinctive number and name, as well as a summary and a rationale written in a non-specific language that everybody can read and understand. </li> <li> Include descriptions of the information to include on the system. </li> <li> Include a full and clear description, or crux, of the desired behavior or operations of the system that correspond to the needs and objectives of the company, the users and experts. </li> <li> Descriptions of the work-flow of the entire system as well as other type of output. </li> <li> Explanation of the way the system accomplishes the regulatory requirements. </li> </ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "assistance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "guidance or help with a task or situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need assistance with this"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rationale"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reason or justification for something to occur"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Now, you ought to always look for some elements like a distinctive number and name, a summary and rationale of the different behaviors of the system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "entry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an informative element "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With our technology, technicians and other professionals had better see entries that describe who can access the inventory and the way people will register products."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "availability"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the quantity of products or goods in stock"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Furthermore, aspects like the transportation means that will be used to bring in products, the way employers will keep track of their availability, among others, ought to be included."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accomplishment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the degree of compliance or achievement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You ought to find as many details as possible that contribute to the accomplishment of all the objectives of the system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the benefit or well-being of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: For the sake of our company, every detail of the customer's goal ought to be addressed and properly met."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n5le02ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about functional requirements for a bank system."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an email with the requirements that you imagine this system must do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a presentation and explain the importance of those requirements to the business."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information about functional."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an email with the requirements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the importance of functional requirements for a bank business."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n5le02ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n5le02ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Albert</span>: I need assistance with this. I do not know if the information here is enough and I basically cannot understand some of it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: Well, you had better ask Peter. He is the expert here. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Albert</span>: Peter. Can you help me in here? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Of course. Well, those are the functional requirements. You'd better be careful with its content as it determines several aspects of the system's behavior. Now, you ought to always look for some elements like a distinctive number and name, a summary and rationale of the different behaviors of the system. Plus, you have to find all sorts of descriptions of the operations and outputs given by the system once it is fully operational. Remember that the language used here ought to be simple and comprehensible."}, {"time": "43000", "image": "enpe8n5le02ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Albert</span>: Do you have any examples? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sure, you might want to check this one out. This is a requirement for an inventory of a market. With our technology, technicians and other professionals had better see entries that describe who can access the inventory and the way people will register products. Furthermore, aspects like the transportation means that will be used to bring in products, the way employers will keep track of their availability, among others, ought to be included. You ought to find as many details as possible that contribute to the accomplishment of all the objectives of the system."}, {"time": "75800", "image": "enpe8n5le02ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Albert</span>: Why is it so important to have so much detailed information? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Functional requirements have a strong incidence in any business. If these functional requests are not done correctly, the system will not accomplish our customer's goals or projects. For the sake of our company, every detail of the customer's goal ought to be addressed and properly met. After all, that is our responsibility."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n5le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can tell what a functional requirement should include."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give examples of functional requirements."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about how functional requirements have an incidence on business."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How important is for businesses to meet their clients' needs?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What type of activities does a system need to do for a business? "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Documenting What a System Must Be Able to Perform "}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Albert needs to learn about functional requirements. "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "You're done!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, 